{"seq":3,"slug":"property-patterns","title":"属性模式与不变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/property-patterns","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"属性模式与不变量\">属性模式与不变量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>属性模式是可复用的不变量模板——往返性（decode(encode(x))=x）、等幂性（f(f(x))=f(x)）、保持性（操作后不变量仍成立）、等价性（新实现与参考实现一致）。掌握这些模式使得属性发现从&quot;灵感依赖&quot;转变为&quot;系统化检索&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性发现的系统化方法\">属性发现的系统化方法</h2><p>编写属性测试最大的挑战不在于框架 API，而在于<strong>属性发现</strong>——如何为被测函数找到有意义的、既不太弱也不太强的不变量。一个过弱的属性（如&quot;函数不抛异常&quot;）提供极少信息；一个过强的属性（如&quot;输出完全等于 X&quot;）退化为举例测试。</p>\n<p>属性发现需要一套系统化的思维框架。以下模式库来自 QuickCheck 社区二十余年的工程实践积累，可覆盖绝大多数场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"往返性模式-round-trip-inverse\">往返性模式（Round-Trip / Inverse）</h2><p>往返性是最强大也最常见的属性模式：如果两个函数互为逆操作，那么它们的组合应该是恒等函数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x \\in T. \\; \\text{decode}(\\text{encode}(x)) = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.binary())&#10;def test_compression_roundtrip(data):&#10;    assert decompress(compress(data)) == data&#10;&#10;@given(user_strategy())&#10;def test_json_roundtrip(user):&#10;    assert User.from_json(user.to_json()) == user\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.binary())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_compression_roundtrip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decompress(compress(data)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_strategy())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_json_roundtrip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User.from_json(user.to_json()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user</span></span></code></pre></div><p>往返性模式的强大之处在于它不需要知道 <code>encode</code> 的具体实现——它只断言一个<em>关系</em>。这使得属性在实现重构时保持稳定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>encode</th>\n<th>decode</th>\n<th>属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td><code>serialize</code></td>\n<td><code>deserialize</code></td>\n<td>往返恒等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密</td>\n<td><code>encrypt(key, -)</code></td>\n<td><code>decrypt(key, -)</code></td>\n<td>往返恒等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码</td>\n<td><code>base64_encode</code></td>\n<td><code>base64_decode</code></td>\n<td>往返恒等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析</td>\n<td><code>format</code></td>\n<td><code>parse</code></td>\n<td>往返恒等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td><code>compress</code></td>\n<td><code>decompress</code></td>\n<td>往返恒等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：往返性不一定严格成立。有损压缩、浮点运算等场景中需要放宽为近似等价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x. \\; ||\\text{decode}(\\text{encode}(x)) - x|| &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"等幂性模式-idempotence\">等幂性模式（Idempotence）</h2><p>对一个操作应用两次与应用一次效果相同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x. \\; f(f(x)) = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.text())&#10;def test_normalize_idempotent(text):&#10;    once = normalize(text)&#10;    twice = normalize(normalize(text))&#10;    assert once == twice&#10;&#10;@given(st.lists(st.integers()))&#10;def test_sort_idempotent(xs):&#10;    assert sort(sort(xs)) == sort(xs)&#10;&#10;@given(html_strategy())&#10;def test_sanitize_idempotent(html):&#10;    assert sanitize(sanitize(html)) == sanitize(html)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.text())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_normalize_idempotent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    once </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalize(text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    twice </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalize(normalize(text))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> once </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> twice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sort_idempotent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort(sort(xs)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort(xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(html_strategy())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sanitize_idempotent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(html):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sanitize(sanitize(html)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sanitize(html)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等幂性模式特别适用于：格式化器、规范化函数、缓存写入、HTTP PUT 操作等。违反等幂性往往意味着函数有副作用或状态依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保持性模式-invariant-preservation\">保持性模式（Invariant Preservation）</h2><p>对数据执行操作后，某些属性必须仍然成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x. \\; I(x) \\implies I(f(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入满足不变量 I] --&gt; B[执行操作 f]&#10;    B --&gt; C[输出仍满足不变量 I]&#10;&#10;    D[有序列表] --&gt; E[插入元素]&#10;    E --&gt; F[仍然有序]&#10;&#10;    G[平衡 BST] --&gt; H[删除节点]&#10;    H --&gt; I[仍然平衡]\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入满足不变量 I] --&gt; B[执行操作 f]\n    B --&gt; C[输出仍满足不变量 I]\n\n    D[有序列表] --&gt; E[插入元素]\n    E --&gt; F[仍然有序]\n\n    G[平衡 BST] --&gt; H[删除节点]\n    H --&gt; I[仍然平衡]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(sorted_list_strategy(), st.integers())&#10;def test_insert_preserves_order(sorted_list, value):&#10;    result = sorted_insert(sorted_list, value)&#10;    assert all(result[i] &lt;= result[i+1] for i in range(len(result)-1))&#10;    assert value in result&#10;    assert len(result) == len(sorted_list) + 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sorted_list_strategy(), st.integers())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_insert_preserves_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sorted_list, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted_insert(sorted_list, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;