le=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> my_sum(tail)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>归纳性模式特别适用于链表、树、编译器 AST 等递归结构的操作验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对称性与反交换性模式\">对称性与反交换性模式</h2><p><strong>对称性</strong>：操作对输入的排列不敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a, b. \\; f(a, b) = f(b, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.integers(), st.integers())&#10;def test_gcd_symmetric(a, b):&#10;    assert gcd(a, b) == gcd(b, a)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.integers(), st.integers())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_gcd_symmetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gcd(a, b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gcd(b, a)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>反交换性</strong>：比较操作的方向性质：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>compare</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>compare</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a, b. \\; \\text{compare}(a, b) = -\\text{compare}(b, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compare</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compare</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"困难情况下的属性策略\">困难情况下的属性策略</h2><p>当被测函数没有明显的数学属性时，以下启发式仍可产生有价值的属性：</p>\n<p><strong>不崩溃属性</strong>：函数对任意合法输入都不应崩溃/panic/抛未捕获异常。这是最弱但最普遍的属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.binary(max_size=4096))&#10;def test_parser_never_crashes(data):&#10;    try:&#10;        parse(data)&#10;    except ParseError:&#10;        pass  # 预期的错误&#10;    # 任何其他异常都是 bug\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.binary(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_parser_never_crashes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parse(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParseError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 预期的错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 任何其他异常都是 bug</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>规模关系</strong>：输出的某些度量与输入之间存在单调或有界关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.lists(st.integers(), min_size=1))&#10;def test_max_in_list(xs):&#10;    assert max(xs) in xs&#10;    assert all(x &lt;= max(xs) for x in xs)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_max_in_list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>统计属性</strong>：对大量样本做统计检验（适用于随机算法、采样器）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>true</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\left(\\left|\\frac{\\text{count}(f(x) = \\text{true})}{N} - p\\right| &gt; \\epsilon\\right) &lt; \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"属性组合的实践原则\">属性组合的实践原则</h2><p>一个被测函数通常需要多个属性共同约束其行为——单个属性很少能完全定义正确性。属性组合的策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>从往返性开始</strong>：如果存在逆操作，往返性通常是最强的单一属性</li>\n<li><strong>补充保持性</strong>：验证数据结构不变量在操作后仍成立</li>\n<li><strong>添加规模约束</strong>：输出长度、值域范围等基本界限</li>\n<li><strong>用等价性兜底</strong>：如果有参考实现可用，直接比对</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一组好的属性应该满足：<strong>任何违反规格的实现至少会被其中一个属性捕获</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>属性模式库为属性发现提供了系统化的思维框架：往返性适用于所有编解码对；等幂性适用于格式化器和规范化函数；保持性验证数据结构不变量；等价性利用参考实现作为 oracle。面对困难场景时，&quot;不崩溃&quot;属性、规模关系和统计检验仍能提供有价值的覆盖。多个属性的组合应确保&quot;任何违反规格的实现至少会被其中一个属性捕获&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 属性模式为函数级测试提供了丰富的工具箱；当需要探索程序更深层路径（尤其是安全漏洞）时，模糊测试提供了覆盖率引导的自动化方案。见 <a href=\"../fuzzing/fuzzing-fundamentals\">模糊测试基础</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"属性模式与不变量","id":"属性模式与不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"属性发现的系统化方法","id":"属性发现的系统化方法"},{"level":2,"text":"往返性模式（Round-Trip / Inverse）","id":"往返性模式-round-trip-inverse"},{"level":2,"text":"等幂性模式（Idempotence）","id":"等幂性模式-idempotence"},{"level":2,"text":"保持性模式（Invariant Preservation）","id":"保持性模式-invariant-preservation"},{"level":2,"text":"等价性模式（Test Oracle / Equivalence）","id":"等价性模式-test-oracle-equivalence"},{"level":2,"text":"归纳性模式（Inductive / Structural）","id":"归纳性模式-inductive-structural"},{"level":2,"text":"对称性与反交换性模式","id":"对称性与反交换性模式"},{"level":2,"text":"困难情况下的属性策略","id":"困难情况下的属性策略"},{"level":2,"text":"属性组合的实践原则","id":"属性组合的实践原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生成器与收缩器机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/generators-shrinking"},"next":{"title":"模糊测试基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/fuzzing-fundamentals"}}